 "message": "Here is what company policy says. Company holidays (POL-HOL-01): Fernhollow observes 11 paid company holidays a year; the list is in the HR portal. The offices close from December 25 to January 1 inclusive. Employees who must work on a company holiday (for example dispatch on-call) get a replacement day off within 60 days.",
